{"id":"42fa8ccd4baf","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-academic-staff","lang":"en","title":"Incoming academic staff","description":"The SEMP programme offers the opportunity to host academic staff from partner universities for a mobiliy stay. Those interested are required to arrange the details of their stay directly with the USI professor with whom they will spend the mobility period. The International Relat","section":"Relint","crumbs":["Relint","Specific information for:"],"image":null,"words":99,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/relint/informazioni-specifiche/corpo-accademico-in-mobilita-all-usi","en":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-academic-staff"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Relint","path":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Specific information for:","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"Incoming academic staff","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The SEMP programme offers the opportunity to host academic staff from partner universities for a mobiliy stay.</p> <p>Those interested are required to arrange the details of their stay directly with the USI professor with whom they will spend the mobility period.</p> <p>The International Relations and Mobility Service is available solely for the supervision of the dossier, the signature of official documents, and the possible allocation of the <a href=\"https://movetia.ch/en/funding-opportunities/stays-abroad-for-staff-in-higher-education/teaching-assignment-for-staff-in-higher-education\">SEMP grant</a>.</p> <p>Please note that if the home university is located in Europe, it is possible to apply for Erasmus+ funding through the home institution.</p> <p>For further details, please visit: <a href=\"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/academic-staff-mobility\">https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/academic-staff-mobility</a></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"International Relations and Study Abroad","href"